<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- UBS starts Ultramar Diamond.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- UBS starts Ultramar Diamond.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Ann Kohler initiated coverage of Ultramar Diamond Shamrock Corp with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- She estimated the company will earn $1.24 per share on a proforma basis in 1996, $2.50 per share in 1997 and $3.35 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Kohnler said that while she believes the stock is fairly valued for now, (the company) &quot;is well positioned to fulfill its objective of being an industry consolidator.&quot;</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
